1 पू पुना॑ति पुनीते॑ प॑वते (˚ति), pp. पूत॑ (q.v.)
cleanse, purify, make clear or bright, sift, discern;
 contrive, invent,
compose;
 M. also clear itself, flow clear;
 grow or be pure (lit. &
fig.). C. पव॑यति or पाव॑यति purify. — अति purify, strain
over or through (acc.);
 M. pass through (the body). अभि M. clear
itself, flow clear towards or for (acc.). आ M. flow clear towards
(acc.) or in (loc.), bestow by flowing (also A.). उद् cleanse, purify.
निस् winnow. परा clear off. परि strain, filter, purify;
 M. flow
off clear. वि cleanse thoroughly. सम् cleanse, purify;
 C. the same.
— Cf. नि॑पूत, परिपूत.
